that was buried under here.
用这个球
就埋在这儿了。

01:41.351 --> 01:44.229
&gt;&gt; Ball!
Let me see it.
>> 球！
让我看看。

01:44.312 --> 01:46.564
What a weird ball.
多么奇怪的球啊。

01:46.648 --> 01:48.399
&gt;&gt; Well, who knows how long
it's--Ahh!
>> 好吧，谁知道要多久
这是——啊！

01:48.483 --> 01:50.443
