>>嘎--谁？
>> 不。

06:08.284 --> 06:10.328
You and I are just gonna
have to find loving homes
你和我只是要
必须找到有爱的家

06:10.411 --> 06:12.538
for each and every one
of these little guys.
为每一个人
这些小家伙。

06:12.622 --> 06:14.040
Right, Patrick?
对吧，帕特里克？

06:14.123 --> 06:15.792
Patrick?
帕特里克？

06:17.460 --> 06:19.712
Don't worry, little guys,
别担心，小家伙们，

06:19.796 --> 06:21.547
Squidward's a really good
friend of mine,
章鱼哥真的很不错
我的朋友，

06:21.631 --> 06:24.258
and he really likes pets.
而且他真的很喜欢宠物。

06:24.342 --> 06:27.470
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob,
what are you doing here?
>> 海绵宝宝,
你在这里做什么？

06:27.553 --> 06:29.806
Don't you know
that it's 7:00 in the morning?
你不知道吗
现在是早上 7:00？

06:29.889 --> 06:31.933
&gt;&gt; Squidward, I came here
with a special surprise.
>> 章鱼哥，我来了
带着特别的惊喜。

06:32.016 --> 06:34.227
&gt;&gt; Don't you know
that it's 7:00 in the morning?
>> 你不知道吗
现在是早上 7:00？

06:34.310 --> 06:37.980
&gt;&gt; How would you like to have
your very own pet baby worm?
>> 你想要怎样
你自己的宠物小蠕虫？

06:38.064 --> 06:39.732
&gt;&gt; Don't you know that it's--
a what?
>> 你难道不知道那是——
一个什么？

06:39.816 --> 06:41.442
&gt;&gt; Baby worm.
See?
>> 蠕虫宝宝。
看？

06:52.703 --> 06:55.665
Aren't they just adorable
at that age?
它们不是很可爱吗
那个年纪？

06:55.748 --> 06:57.375
So how many did you want?
那么你想要多少个？

07:00.628 --> 07:02.421
&gt;&gt; Yes?
>> 是吗？

07:02.505 --> 07:05.299
Oh, it's you, SpongeBob.
哦，是你，海绵宝宝。

07:11.556 --> 07:14.016
Not that a teacher's
most enthusiastic student
不是老师的
最热情的学生

07:14.100 --> 07:16.811
isn't welcome in her house.
她家里不受欢迎。

07:34.871 --> 07:36.622
&gt;&gt; Good morning, Mrs. Puff.
>> 早上好，普芙女士。

07:36.706 --> 07:38.499
&gt;&gt; It almost was.
>> 几乎就是这样。

07:38.583 --> 07:40.126
&gt;&gt; Would you like a baby worm?
>> 你想要一只小蠕虫吗？

07:40.209 --> 07:42.545
&gt;&gt; A what?
Aaaaaahh!
>> 一个什么？
啊啊啊！

07:45.298 --> 07:47.341
&gt;&gt; I-I'll just come back later,
Mrs. Puff.
>> 我、我稍后再回来，
泡芙女士。

07:47.425 --> 07:50.636
Have a nice day.
祝你今天过得愉快。

07:50.720 --> 07:53.556
&gt;&gt; I hate Mondays.
>> 我讨厌星期一。

07:53.639 --> 07:55.892
&gt;&gt; Don't worry, little worms.
>> 别担心，小虫子。

07:55.975 --> 07:57.643
