08:11.365 --> 08:13.367
Hi, Larry.
What you up to?
嗨，拉里。
你想做什么？

08:13.451 --> 08:14.660
&gt;&gt; Do I know you?
>> 我认识你吗？

08:14.744 --> 08:16.495
&gt;&gt; Probably not.
>> 可能不是。

08:16.579 --> 08:18.414
&gt;&gt; I was just picking up
some dietary supplements
>> 我刚刚接电话
一些膳食补充剂

08:18.497 --> 08:20.208
here at the supermarket.
在超市这里。

08:20.291 --> 08:22.501
I've been working
on my chest and buns.
我一直在工作
在我的胸部和发髻上。

08:22.585 --> 08:23.878
&gt;&gt; So I see.
>> 所以我明白了。

08:23.961 --> 08:25.421
&gt;&gt; Well, catch you later.
>> 好吧，稍后见。

08:25.504 --> 08:26.672
&gt;&gt; Oh, Larry, wait.
>> 哦，拉里，等等。

08:26.756 --> 08:28.549
&gt;&gt; No time now.
>> 现在没时间。

08:28.633 --> 08:29.884
Somewhere there's sand
that needs kicking.
某处有沙子
需要踢。

08:29.967 --> 08:32.053
&gt;&gt; Okay.
>> 好的。

08:32.136 --> 08:33.554
I was just gonna see
if you wanted one of these poor,
我只是想看看
如果你想成为这些穷人中的一员

08:33.638 --> 08:35.223
