Err.
>>
错误。

09:03.876 --> 09:05.127
&gt;&gt; Aahh!
>> 啊啊！

09:33.823 --> 09:35.074
Oh, little wormies.
噢，小虫子们。

09:35.157 --> 09:37.410
I'm so glad you're safe.
我很高兴你安全了。

09:37.493 --> 09:40.413
Now, lets go see about finding
you those homes I promised.
现在，让我们看看如何找到
你是我答应过的那些家。

09:44.625 --> 09:46.961
Yello?
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob, it's Mr. Krabs.
耶罗？
>> 海绵宝宝，是蟹老板。

09:47.044 --> 09:48.879
I've been looking all over
for you.
我一直在寻找
为了你。

09:48.963 --> 09:50.339
You're three hours late
for work!
你迟到了三个小时
为了工作！

09:50.423 --> 09:51.465
&gt;&gt; Aaaaaah!
>> 啊啊啊！

09:51.549 --> 09:53.426
&gt;&gt; Hello?
>> 你好？

09:53.509 --> 09:55.094
&gt;&gt;
I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
>>
对不起，蟹老板。

09:55.177 --> 09:57.263
I came as quick as I could.
我尽快赶来。

09:57.346 --> 09:59.432
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob, are you sure
you're feeling shipshape?
>> 海绵宝宝，你确定吗
你感觉状态良好吗？

09:59.515 --> 10:01.142
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

10:01.225 --> 10:03.519
I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
对不起，蟹老板。

10:03.602 --> 10:05.980
My pet worm had babies
then got chased away,
我的宠物蠕虫生了孩子
然后就被赶走了

10:06.063 --> 10:07.982
and now I gotta find 'em all
a place to live.
现在我要把他们全部找到
一个居住的地方。

10:08.065 --> 10:09.734
&gt;&gt; Babies?
&gt;&gt; Yeah.
>> 婴儿？
>> 是的。

10:09.817 --> 10:11.360
&gt;&gt; Let me see.
>> 让我看看。

10:11.444 --> 10:13.279
&gt;&gt; Really?
&gt;&gt; Yeah, come on.
>> 真的吗？
>> 是的，来吧。

10:13.362 --> 10:14.739
Let me see 'em.
I like babies.
让我看看他们。
我喜欢婴儿。

10:14.822 --> 10:16.574
&gt;&gt; Well, okay.
>> 好吧，好吧。

10:16.657 --> 10:17.908
&gt;&gt;
Hey, there, little critters.
>>
嘿，那里，小动物们。

10:17.992 --> 10:19.577
Come to--
来——

10:21.662 --> 10:23.664
&gt;&gt; Aw, he likes you.
>> 噢，他喜欢你。

10:23.748 --> 10:26.500
&gt;&gt; Get that disgusting vermin
outta me restaurant, pronto.
>> 消灭那些恶心的害虫
离开我的餐厅，很快。

10:26.584 --> 10:30.254
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

10:30.338 --> 10:31.547
&gt;&gt; Bleh!
>> 哎呀！

10:33.674 --> 10:35.926
&gt;&gt; Oh, well.
>> 哦，好吧。

10:36.010 --> 10:38.137
At least
I still have you guys.
至少
我还有你们呢。

10:48.189 --> 10:51.275
&gt;&gt;
Hmmm.
>>
嗯。

10:53.527 --> 10:55.112
&gt;&gt; What is it?
>> 这是什么？

10:55.196 --> 10:57.365
&gt;&gt; I'd recognize this goo
anywhere.
>> 我会认出这个粘糊糊的东西
任何地方。

10:57.448 --> 11:00.284
It comes from a baby spotted
glistening meadow worm,
它来自一个被发现的婴儿
闪闪发光的草地蠕虫，

11:00.368 --> 11:02.620
the rarest of its species.
其物种中最稀有的。

11:02.703 --> 11:04.830
&gt;&gt; Dude, those things are worth
a fortune.
>> 伙计，那些东西是值得的
一笔财富。

11:04.914 --> 11:06.957
&gt;&gt; Did you say, "fortune"?
>> 你说的是“财富”吗？

11:07.041 --> 11:08.626
Ka-ching!
嘉庆！

11:08.709 --> 11:10.503
$5.99.
5.99 美元。

11:10.586 --> 11:12.088
That's right,
get 'em while they last.
没错，
趁它们还剩的时候，把它们拿走。

11:12.171 --> 11:13.839
Don't be shy, folks.
别害羞，伙计们。

11:13.923 --> 11:15.716
&gt;&gt; These things are so cute.
>> 这些东西太可爱了。

11:15.800 --> 11:18.844
&gt;&gt; Enjoy your new home,
little guy.
>> 享受你的新家，
小家伙。

11:18.928 --> 11:23.140
&gt;&gt; Isn't he just adorable?
>> 他是不是很可爱？

11:25.393 --> 11:27.520
&gt;&gt; That sure was a great idea
you had, Mr. Krabs.
>> 这确实是个好主意
你有，蟹老板。

11:27.603 --> 11:29.188
&gt;&gt; Well, it's like
they always say
>> 嗯，就像
他们总是说

11:29.271 --> 11:31.107
back in the old country, lad.
回到祖国吧，小伙子。

11:31.190 --> 11:33.109
&gt;&gt; What's that?
&gt;&gt; I don't know.
>> 那是什么？
>> 我不知道。

11:33.192 --> 11:34.568
I've never been
to the old country!
我从来没有去过
到故国去！

11:42.243 --> 11:48.457
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:48.541 --> 11:51.252
&gt;&gt; Oh, come on, Karen.
Please.
>> 哦，来吧，凯伦。
请。

11:51.335 --> 11:53.254
&gt;&gt; Well, if you must know--
>> 好吧，如果你一定要知道的话——

11:53.337 --> 11:55.339
&gt;&gt; There's nothing wrong
with Chum Bucket fare.
>> 没有什么问题
含 Chum Bucket 票价。

11:55.423 --> 11:57.341
Why, look.
为什么，看。

11:57.425 --> 11:59.218
Here's a fresh batch
of a delicious new chum sauce.
这是一批新鲜的
美味的新密友酱。

11:59.301 --> 12:03.055
It's called
spicy chum surprise.
它被称为
辣密友惊喜。

12:03.139 --> 12:04.807
Uh...
呃...

12:16.527 --> 12:18.320
Delectable.
令人愉快的。

12:18.404 --> 12:21.240
&gt;&gt; Oh, I'm sure it will be
a huge success.
>> 哦，我确信会的
取得了巨大的成功。

12:23.159 --> 12:25.619
&gt;&gt; Sorry, no time
for your senseless chatter.
>> 抱歉，没时间
为了你无意义的喋喋不休。

12:25.703 --> 12:27.913
I've got a customer
to attend to.
我有一个客户
去参加。

12:30.082 --> 12:31.417
&gt;&gt; Okay, so,
>> 好吧，那么，

12:31.500 --> 12:32.960
What about the Krabby Kola?
蟹黄可拉怎么样？

12:33.043 --> 12:35.087
&gt;&gt; We don't serve Krabby Kola.
>> 我们不提供蟹黄可乐。

12:35.171 --> 12:38.883
We carry Bucket Bubbler
and Chum Cherry Blast.
我们携带桶式起泡器
和密友樱桃爆炸。

12:38.966 --> 12:41.177
&gt;&gt; Okay, well then,
can I just make sure
>> 好吧，那么，
我可以确定一下吗

12:41.260 --> 12:44.054
I get those Krabby Fries
with extra Krabby Sauce?
我买了蟹黄薯条
加额外的蟹黄酱？

12:44.138 --> 12:45.514
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

12:45.598 --> 12:47.641
How many times must I say it?
我必须说多少次？

12:47.725 --> 12:49.852
We don't carry Krabby Fries,
我们不卖蟹黄薯条，

12:49.935 --> 12:51.729
we don't carry Krabby Kola,
我们不携带蟹黄可拉，

12:51.812 --> 12:53.898
we don't carry Krabby Sauce,
我们没有蟹黄酱，

12:53.981 --> 12:56.317
and we don't carry
Krabby Patties!
我们不携带
蟹肉饼！

12:56.400 --> 12:58.444
So if you want
any of those things,
所以如果你想要
任何这些事情，

12:58.527 --> 13:00.696
you're going to have to go
to the Krusty Krab,
你得走了
到蟹堡王，

13:00.779 --> 13:02.781
which is located directly
across the street.
它直接位于
街对面。

13:02.865 --> 13:05.826
&gt;&gt; Thanks for the directions.
&gt;&gt; Any time.
>> 感谢您的指导。
>> 任何时间。

13:08.329 --> 13:12.124
What is wrong with people!
人怎么了！

13:12.208 --> 13:15.002
Honestly, I don't think anyone
in Bikini Bottom would know
老实说，我认为没有人
穿比基尼底就知道

13:15.085 --> 13:17.171
a decent meal if it looked them
right in the eye and said,
如果看起来像一顿美餐
就在眼前说道：

13:17.254 --> 13:20.549
"Hello, I'm a decent meal.
Wonderful to meet you.
“你好，我是一顿饭。
很高兴见到你。

13:20.633 --> 13:23.135
"Please, pay money for me
and then put me in your mouth
“请帮我付钱
然后把我放进你嘴里

13:23.219 --> 13:25.304
"so your old pal Plankton
doesn't lose everything
“所以你的老朋友浮游生物
并没有失去一切

13:25.387 --> 13:28.098
he's spent his entire life
working for!"
他一生都在
为之工作！”

13:28.182 --> 13:30.768
&gt;&gt; Yeah, and if anyone ever did
order one of your meals,
>> 是的，如果有人曾经这样做过
点一份餐食，

13:30.851 --> 13:32.978
it probably would look them
in the eye.
它可能会看起来像他们
在眼睛里。

13:33.062 --> 13:35.523
&gt;&gt; You know, Karen, sometimes
I wonder if you're here
>> 你知道，凯伦，有时
我想知道你是否在这里

13:35.606 --> 13:37.483
to help me run the Chum Bucket
帮助我运行 Chum Bucket

13:37.566 --> 13:40.486
or just to make me feel
like I'm two inches tall.
或者只是为了让我感觉
就像我有两英寸高一样。

13:40.569 --> 13:42.029
Ding!
叮！

13:43.322 --> 13:44.657
&gt;&gt; Maybe in heels.
>> 也许穿高跟鞋。

13:44.740 --> 13:46.784
If it wasn't for me,
如果不是我的话

13:46.867 --> 13:48.452
you probably wouldn't even
remember to blink.
你可能甚至不会
记得眨眼。

13:48.536 --> 13:50.287
&gt;&gt; Oh, come on.
>> 哦，来吧。

13:50.371 --> 13:52.331
When we first met,
you were little more
当我们第一次见面时，
你还差一点

13:52.414 --> 13:54.041
than a jumbled mass
of diodes and wires.
比一团杂乱的东西
二极管和电线。

13:54.124 --> 13:56.502
I made you what you are today,
是我造就了今天的你

13:56.585 --> 13:58.504
literally.
字面上地。

13:58.587 --> 14:00.381
So don't think you couldn't be
replaced in a heartbeat.
所以不要认为你不能
心跳更换。

14:00.464 --> 14:01.757
Ow!
噢！

14:01.840 --> 14:03.842
&gt;&gt; What's the matter?
>> 怎么了？

14:03.926 --> 14:06.095
&gt;&gt; My eye is burning,
and I don't know why!
>> 我的眼睛在燃烧，
我不知道为什么！

14:06.178 --> 14:07.972
&gt;&gt; Blink.
>> 眨眼。

14:09.181 --> 14:10.808
&gt;&gt; Oh, yeah.
Thanks for reminding me.
>> 哦，是的。
谢谢你提醒我。

14:10.891 --> 14:12.851
Now where was I?
现在我在哪里？

14:12.935 --> 14:14.687
&gt;&gt; You were threatening
to replace me.
>> 你在威胁
来代替我。

14:14.770 --> 14:16.814
&gt;&gt; Oh, yeah.
I don't need you!
>> 哦，是的。
我不需要你！

14:16.897 --> 14:19.066
I could make a whole army
of computers
我可以组建一支完整的军队
计算机数量

14:19.149 --> 14:21.694
that might actually help me
steal the formula.
这实际上可能对我有帮助
窃取公式。

14:21.777 --> 14:23.362
&gt;&gt; Oh, puh-leez.
>> 噢，噗噗。

14:23.445 --> 14:25.447
&gt;&gt; I'll show you, woman.
>> 我会告诉你，女人。

14:28.284 --> 14:30.411
Oh, Karen?
哦，凯伦？

14:32.538 --> 14:34.206
&gt;&gt; Now what.
>> 现在做什么。

14:34.290 --> 14:37.042
&gt;&gt; Could you come here
for a moment?
>> 你能过来一下吗
一会儿？

14:37.126 --> 14:38.836
&gt;&gt; What do you want?
>> 你想要什么？

14:38.919 --> 14:41.213
&gt;&gt; Feast your...
Uh...
>> 盛宴您的...
呃...

14:41.297 --> 14:43.507
Screen on this.
屏幕上显示这一点。

14:46.635 --> 14:50.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:53.058 --> 14:54.852
&gt;&gt; That's my replacement?
>> 这是我的替代者吗？

14:54.935 --> 14:56.312
It's a toaster.
这是一个烤面包机。

14:56.395 --> 14:58.105
&gt;&gt; Ha, ha, ha!
>> 哈哈哈哈！

14:58.188 --> 15:02.484
That, my dear,
is a T-119A Compumatic.
那个，亲爱的，
是 T-119A 计算机。

15:02.568 --> 15:04.653
The finest of its kind.
同类中最好的。

15:04.737 --> 15:06.739
&gt;&gt; Good morning, sir.
>> 早上好，先生。

15:06.822 --> 15:10.117
&gt;&gt; Good morning, T-119A!
>> 早上好，T-119A！

15:12.745 --> 15:14.663
They're supposed to do that.
他们应该这样做。

15:16.749 --> 15:18.751
Next, behold
接下来，看

15:18.834 --> 15:21.879
the noxious enterprises
super SP-U31
有害企业
超级SP-U31

15:21.962 --> 15:24.173
liquid-cooled mobile
processing unit.
液冷移动
处理单元。

15:24.256 --> 15:29.345
A mind-staggering combination
of both power and refinement.
令人震惊的组合
力量与精致兼备。

15:31.597 --> 15:34.600
Clunk!
Clunk!
叮当！
叮当！

15:44.860 --> 15:46.904
&gt;&gt; That'll help you
get the formula.
>> 这会对你有帮助
得到公式。

15:46.987 --> 15:50.366
&gt;&gt; And now, Karen,
the piece  de resistance.
>> 现在，凯伦，
抵抗之作。

15:52.368 --> 15:55.954
Have you ever witnessed
such marvelous machinery?
你是否曾见证过
如此奇妙的机械？

15:56.038 --> 15:58.957
&gt;&gt; It sort of just looks like
an old hair dryer
>> 看起来有点像
一个旧吹风机

15:59.041 --> 16:00.876
taped to the back
of a miniature windmill.
贴在背面
的微型风车。

16:00.959 --> 16:03.295
&gt;&gt; I could see how someone
at your level
>> 我可以看到某人如何
在你的水平

16:03.379 --> 16:06.131
of technical knowledge
would think that, Karen.
技术知识
会这么想，凯伦。

16:06.215 --> 16:09.677
But in actuality
what you are looking at is--
但实际上
你正在看的是——

16:09.760 --> 16:11.553
Oh, right.
哦，对了。

16:11.637 --> 16:13.555
&gt;&gt; I don't recall
you ever having reason
>> 我不记得了
你曾经有过理由

16:13.639 --> 16:15.015
to own a hair dryer, Plankton.
拥有一个吹风机，Plankton。

16:15.099 --> 16:17.476
&gt;&gt; Okay, here we go.
>> 好的，我们开始吧。

16:17.559 --> 16:19.937
Are you gonna make me
get the picture down again?
你要让我
把照片再放下来？

16:20.020 --> 16:21.897
&gt;&gt; What picture?
>> 什么图片？

16:30.322 --> 16:32.074
&gt;&gt; You see?
>> 你看到了吗？

16:32.157 --> 16:34.159
Plenty of reason to be using
a hair dryer.
有充分的理由使用
吹风机。

16:34.243 --> 16:36.370
&gt;&gt; Why are we even talking
about this?
>> 我们为什么要谈论
关于这个？

16:36.453 --> 16:38.664
&gt;&gt; Because you were the one
who said--
>> 因为你就是那个
谁说——

16:40.082 --> 16:41.458
&gt;&gt; What's going on?
>> 这是怎么回事？

16:41.542 --> 16:43.085
&gt;&gt; Dear Neptune!
>> 亲爱的海王星！

16:43.168 --> 16:45.546
Karen, do something.
凯伦，做点什么。

16:45.629 --> 16:47.256
Quick!
快的！

16:47.339 --> 16:49.174
They're tearing
each other apart.
他们在流泪
彼此分开。

16:49.258 --> 16:51.510
Just press a button
or something.
只需按一个按钮
或者什么的。

16:52.803 --> 16:53.971
Not that one!
不是那个！

16:55.431 --> 16:56.598
Aaaaah!
啊啊啊！

16:58.642 --> 17:03.188
&gt;&gt; Well, it's good to see
that strategy didn't fall flat.
>> 嗯，很高兴看到
这一策略并没有失败。

17:03.272 --> 17:05.274
&gt;&gt; You know, Karen,
with you around
>> 你知道，凯伦，
有你在身边

17:05.357 --> 17:08.193
I'm beginning to wonder
how I'm still alive.
我开始想知道
我怎么还活着。

17:08.277 --> 17:11.864
&gt;&gt; Oh, so it's my fault, is it?
>> 哦，所以这是我的错，是吗？

17:11.947 --> 17:14.199
&gt;&gt; That's right!
Now it's all clear.
>> 没错！
现在一切都清楚了。

17:14.283 --> 17:16.368
It's you who've been
holding me back.
原来是你
阻止我。

17:16.452 --> 17:18.912
In fact, if it weren't
for your constant stifling,
事实上，如果不是
为了你不断的窒息，

17:18.996 --> 17:22.291
I'd have the whole world running
for the safety of their mommies!
我会让整个世界运转起来
为了妈妈们的安全！

17:22.374 --> 17:25.002
&gt;&gt; You and your crack team
of robots, huh?
>> 你和你的精英团队
机器人，是吧？

17:27.004 --> 17:29.006
&gt;&gt; Maybe I could iron out
a few bugs.
>>也许我可以解决这个问题
一些错误。

17:29.089 --> 17:32.551
But then you'll see
just how much I need you.
但随后你会看到
我是多么需要你。

17:32.634 --> 17:34.303
Karen?
凯伦？

17:34.386 --> 17:36.889
What's this?
It's words on paper.
这是什么？
这是纸上的话。

17:36.972 --> 17:39.516
It says, "Dear Plankton,
它说：“亲爱的浮游生物，

17:39.600 --> 17:41.852
"I've logged
onto another network.
“我已经登录了
到另一个网络。

17:41.935 --> 17:44.271
"I just can't go into sleep mode
at night
“我就是无法进入睡眠模式
晚上

17:44.354 --> 17:45.981
"knowing that you'll continue
blaming me
“知道你会继续
怪我

17:46.064 --> 17:48.150
"for all of your failures.
“为了你所有的失败。

17:48.233 --> 17:50.319
"Anyway, you're a grown
single-celled organism
“不管怎样，你已经长大了
单细胞生物

17:50.402 --> 17:53.030
"and allowed to make
your own syntax errors.
“并允许使
你自己的语法错误。

17:53.113 --> 17:55.073
Nice knowing you.
--Karen."
很高兴认识你。
——凯伦。”

17:55.157 --> 17:57.367
Ha! Who needs her?
哈!谁需要她？

17:57.451 --> 17:59.244
Not me.
不是我。

17:59.328 --> 18:01.288
I'm going to steal
that Krabby Patty formula
我要去偷
蟹黄派配方

18:01.371 --> 18:03.332
from Mr. Krabs
once and for all.
来自蟹老板
一劳永逸。

18:03.415 --> 18:05.959
And then we'll see
who's made the error.
然后我们就会看到
谁犯了错误。

18:11.632 --> 18:13.091
Ow!
噢！

18:13.175 --> 18:16.053
"p.s.: Don't forget to blink."
“ps：别忘了眨眼。”

18:16.136 --> 18:17.679
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

18:19.515 --> 18:20.641
Okay, team.
好的，团队。

18:20.724 --> 18:22.059
Listen up.
听着。

18:22.142 --> 18:24.019
We're on our own now,
我们现在只能靠自己了

18:24.102 --> 18:25.938
so we don't have anything
holding us back.
所以我们什么都没有
阻碍我们。

18:26.021 --> 18:29.316
Now, I know you all look upon me
kindly since I am your creator,
现在，我知道你们都在看着我
善意的，因为我是你的创造者，

18:29.399 --> 18:31.693
but the last thing
the Chum Bucket needs
但最后一件事
密友桶需要

18:31.777 --> 18:35.114
if we are going to be victorious
is a bunch of soft--
如果我们要取得胜利
是一团柔软的——

18:35.197 --> 18:37.282
Uh, software.
呃，软件。

18:37.366 --> 18:39.785
Does everybody understand?
大家都明白了吗？

18:41.453 --> 18:42.955
Ding!
叮！

18:45.165 --> 18:48.001
I said, "Does everybody
understand?"
我说：“大家都
明白吗？”

18:49.962 --> 18:51.213
All right, then.
Let's do this!
好吧，那么。
让我们这样做吧！

18:51.296 --> 18:53.966
T-119A to position.
T-119A 就位。

18:55.259 --> 18:57.469
SP-U31 to position!
SP-U31到位！

18:59.179 --> 19:00.931
Command module to position!
命令模块定位！

19:04.017 --> 19:06.562
Now let's see Krabs stop this.
现在让我们看看蟹老板阻止这一切。

19:06.645 --> 19:08.063
I'll show him.
我会告诉他。

19:08.146 --> 19:09.815
I'll show them all!
我会向他们展示全部！

19:12.985 --> 19:14.945
&gt;&gt; This just in.
>> 这个刚刚进来。

19:15.028 --> 19:16.822
A diabolical albeit haphazardly
thrown together machine
恶魔虽然偶然
拼凑机

19:16.905 --> 19:18.657
is attacking Bikini Bottom
正在攻击比基尼泳裤

19:18.740 --> 19:20.742
and is headed straight
for the Krusty Kra--
并直行
对于 Krusty Kra——

19:20.826 --> 19:23.328
&gt;&gt; Why is the local news
always such rubbish?
>> 为什么是本地新闻
总是这么垃圾？

19:23.412 --> 19:25.372
&gt;&gt; Hey, Squidward, look!
>> 嘿，章鱼哥，看！

19:25.455 --> 19:27.332
I finally figured out a way
to get my mop wet
我终于想出了一个办法
把我的拖把弄湿

19:27.416 --> 19:29.293
without dipping it
in the bucket.
不沾它
在桶里。

19:29.376 --> 19:30.836
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob,
nobody cares about--
>> 海绵宝宝,
没人关心——

19:41.513 --> 19:44.600
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

19:45.934 --> 19:47.269
Hey!
嘿！

19:47.352 --> 19:50.314
Krabs, I wanna see you.
蟹蟹我想见你

19:52.608 --> 19:54.776
&gt;&gt; Oh, okay, boy.
Get out there.
>> 哦，好吧，孩子。
出去吧。

19:58.614 --> 20:00.240
&gt;&gt; Um, hello.
>> 嗯，你好。

20:00.324 --> 20:03.368
What do you want,
robot thing, sir?
你想要什么，
先生，机器人的事情吗？

20:03.452 --> 20:06.663
Oh, hey, plankton.
What are you doing here?
哦，嘿，浮游生物。
你在这里做什么？

20:06.747 --> 20:09.333
&gt;&gt; I'm here for the secret
formula, you twit.
>> 我来这里是为了秘密
公式，你这个笨蛋。

20:09.416 --> 20:11.710
I want you to go in there
and tell Krabs
我要你进去
并告诉蟹老板

20:11.793 --> 20:14.421
that if he doesn't turn over
the formula to me,
如果他不翻身
给我的公式，

20:14.504 --> 20:17.424
he will be subjected
to utter annihilation at my--
他将受到
彻底消灭我的——

20:17.507 --> 20:19.676
Are you getting this?
你明白了吗？

20:19.760 --> 20:21.136
&gt;&gt; Mm-hmm.
>> 嗯嗯。

20:21.219 --> 20:23.430
&gt;&gt; Ugh! Moron.
>> 呃！白痴。

20:23.513 --> 20:26.224
Okay, I'll make it simple.
好吧，我会简单点的。

20:26.308 --> 20:29.186
Krabs give me secret formula,
螃蟹给我秘方，

20:29.269 --> 20:32.189
or I bring big boom-boom
to Krusty Krab.
或者我带来巨大的繁荣
到蟹堡王。

20:32.272 --> 20:34.107
Got it?
知道了？

20:34.191 --> 20:37.069
&gt;&gt; Krabs give me
secret formula, or--
>> 螃蟹给我
秘密配方，或者——

20:37.152 --> 20:38.654
What was that other thing?
那另一件事是什么？

20:38.737 --> 20:40.739
&gt;&gt; Argh, forget it!
>> 唉，算了！

20:45.744 --> 20:47.788
Bring on the boom-boom!
带来繁荣繁荣！

20:53.377 --> 20:56.338
&gt;&gt; Battle stations, men!
Here he comes!
>> 战斗站，伙计们！
他来了！

20:57.714 --> 20:59.424
&gt;&gt; We're all doomed!
We're all doomed!
>> 我们都注定了！
我们都注定了！

20:59.508 --> 21:01.093
We're all doomed!
We're all doomed!
我们都注定了！
我们都注定了！

21:01.176 --> 21:02.970
Doomed, doomed,
doomed, doomed, doomed!
注定了，注定了，
注定了，注定了，注定了！

21:03.053 --> 21:04.638
We're all doomed!
We're all doomed!
我们都注定了！
我们都注定了！

21:04.721 --> 21:06.974
We're all doomed!
We're all doomed!
我们都注定了！
我们都注定了！

