21:52.686 --> 21:53.979
Karen!
凯伦！

21:54.062 --> 21:55.814
You've come back to me.
你已经回到我身边了。

21:55.897 --> 21:58.191
&gt;&gt; Actually, I just came
to get my keyboard.
>> 其实我刚来
拿到我的键盘。

21:58.275 --> 22:00.527
&gt;&gt; Oh, I knew
you couldn't stay away.
>>哦，我知道
你不能离开。

22:00.610 --> 22:01.319
I knew it.
我就知道。

22:01.403 --> 22:02.446
&gt;&gt;
Right.
>>
对。

22:02.529 --> 22:05.115
Let Me Guess:
Another failure?
让我猜猜：
又一次失败？

22:05.198 --> 22:08.326
&gt;&gt; What're ya gonna do?
Machines these days, right?
>> 你要做什么？
现在的机器，对吧？

22:08.410 --> 22:09.995
Uh, listen, sweetie,
呃，听着，亲爱的，

22:10.078 --> 22:12.706
I'm sorry about what I said.
我对我所说的话感到抱歉。

22:12.789 --> 22:16.418
The truth is, I could never
replace you, honey bunch.
事实是，我永远无法
取代你，亲爱的。

22:16.501 --> 22:18.712
Let's go home, huh?
我们回家吧，嗯？

22:20.964 --> 22:23.383
&gt;&gt;
okay.
>>
好的。

22:25.969 --> 22:27.763
&gt;&gt; Hey, I could whip us up
a little dinner.
>> 嘿，我可以鞭策我们
一点晚餐。

22:27.846 --> 22:29.514
What do you say?
你怎么说？

22:29.598 --> 22:31.391
&gt;&gt; You want me
to leave you again?
>> 你想要我
又要离开你了吗？

22:31.475 --> 22:33.268
&gt;&gt; Or we could go out.
That'd be fun too.
>> 或者我们可以出去。
那也很有趣。

